Z||000000||ChadMan||08-10-2001||05:34 PM||||Found out this week that James Dean was almost certainly gay.  I had always thought of him as a Porsche-racing, skirt-chasing kind of guy...then I watched the TNT movie about him and they hinted around that he batted from both sides of the plate.  So I checked a couple of Dean biographies out of the library.  Seems the debate is not about whether or not he was gay (that's a given), but rather, about whether he was gay or bi.  (Not that there's anything wrong with that...)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Damned media.  Do we have to know every little detail about the private life of every celebrity and politician?  I always pictured Dean driving his 550 Spyder in the Great Beyond with his arm around Natalie Wood...now I'll picture him with his arm around Rock Hudson.  <P>Oh well, long as he's happy.  Rest in peace, Jimmy.<p>[This message has been edited by ChadMan (edited 08-10-2001).]||||reg||3
